Third-party material bundled for reproducibility (not original project work):

  * apps/vit/assets/imagenet_classes.txt
      The ImageNet-1k class list. Public reference data.

  * apps/vit/assets/sample_dog.jpg
      A single sample photograph used only as demo input for the ViT
      benchmark (apps/vit/vit_benchmark.py).

  * The ViT-Tiny reference model reproduced in apps/vit/vit_numpy.py follows
      the architecture of "vit_tiny_patch16_224" from the `timm` library;
      pretrained weights are fetched by apps/vit/export_vit_weights.py at
      setup time and are NOT redistributed in this repository.
